#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool | What it tells you or does | Step | Docs |\n"
"|---|---|---|---|\n"
"| Specially calibrated instructions | Non-standard calibrations that can benefit some experiments. | 2.1 | [Documentation](/guides/custom-calibration) |\n"
"| Qubit quality benchmarking | Refreshes device properties data. | 2.2 | [Tutorial](/tutorials/refresh-backend-properties-with-real-time-benchmarking) |\n"
"| Timing for scheduled circuits | Visualizes when each instruction runs, to help spot idle time and inefficient instruction alignment. | 2.4 | [Documentation](/guides/qiskit-runtime-circuit-timing) |\n"
"| `select-error-mitigation` AI agent skill | Compares error mitigation methods for your workload and reports which ones to use and why. | 3.2 | [GitHub repository](https://github.com/Qiskit/skills) |\n"
"| Client-side primitives | New implementations of the primitives that show more detail about pre- and post-processing, and give you more control over it. | 3.2 | [Documentation](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) |\n"
"| `NoiseLearnerV3` | Performs noise learning by using both the Pauli-Lindblad and TREX protocols. | 3.3 | [Documentation](/guides/noise-learning) |\n"
"| Local mode | Verifies syntactic correctness and compares the effects of different error mitigation methods. | 3.4 | [Documentation](/guides/local-testing-mode) |\n"
